 Smart right – Emergency Healthcare Management System

 Project Overview

Smart right is an Android-based healthcare and emergency management application developed as part of my MCA project.

The system is designed to support users during emergency situations by providing healthcare-related services, emergency assistance, tracking, communication, and other management features through a mobile application.

 Objectives

- Provide healthcare and emergency assistance through a mobile application
- Support emergency situation management
- Enable location-based tracking and assistance
- Improve communication between users and healthcare-related services
- Provide convenient access to healthcare information and services

