- XML
- Android
- Android Studio
- Firebase
- Retrofit
- GPS / Location Services
- IoT concepts

 Key Features
- Emergency assistance
- Location/GPS-based tracking
- Healthcare service management
- Communication features
- Appointment-related functionality
- Healthcare report management
- Mobile-based user interface

